    "sourceText": "Pip goes shopping for a brush. There it is, on a high shelf in the shop. The counter is empty except for a little bell. Pip rings it once and waits. The shopkeeper comes out of the back room and gets the brush. “Thank you,” says Pip, taking the brush.",
