    "sourceText": "Fluff uses a wide brush to paint a road on paper. A thin brush makes short lines down the middle. Beside the road, Fluff leaves room for a park. The toy cars are ready before the road is. Fluff waits until the paint dries to put them down. Then Fluff shows Socks the new place to play.",
