    "sourceText": "In the sunshine, Socks finds a shadow on the wall. One arm goes up. The shadow on the wall lifts an arm too! Pip holds a leaf up beside Socks. A smaller shape appears next to the first one. Socks shows Pip how closely that shape matches the leaf.",
