    "sourceText": "Three clean dishes sit side by side on a towel. Chips puts the biggest dish on the shelf. The middle dish fits inside it like a little bowl. The smallest dish fits inside the middle one. Chips stacks all three in that one spot. The empty towel can go back on its hook.",
