    "sourceText": "Chompy brings a box of cheese triangles to lunch. There are three plates, for Chompy, Pip and Socks. Chompy puts one triangle on each plate. Three triangles still sit in the box, enough for another round. Each friend gets one more. Now there are two on every plate and none in the box.",
