    "sourceText": "Rain has left the first park bench wet. Muddy carries lunch past it and checks the bench under a roof. Dry! Muddy opens the lunch box there. At the other bench, a bird lands right where Muddy nearly sat. Muddy eats under the roof and watches the bird.",
