    "sourceText": "Deep in the costume chest, Fluff finds an old sock. Fluff chooses two buttons for a pair of eyes. Muddy helps sew them on. A red cloth tongue hangs below the chin. Fluff slips a paw inside the sock and opens its mouth. A little bow from the puppet makes Pip laugh.",
