    "sourceText": "The soup is so thick that Chompy can hardly pour it. Chompy stirs it with a spoon, but it stays thick. Muddy adds a little warm water. Chompy stirs again. Now the soup is thin enough to pour into two bowls. They leave the bowls to cool before taking a taste.",
