    "sourceText": "Three plants share a windowsill. Pip feels the soil in each pot before getting any water. The first two pots feel damp. Only the third has dry soil. Pip waters that plant, and some water runs into its tray. After emptying the tray, Pip puts the pot beside the others again.",
