    "sourceText": "Pip cut shapes in a sheet of paper. A few folds would make it into a lantern. An adult brought a little lamp with a battery. There was no hot flame, so the lamp was safe inside. “Let’s take it outside,” said Pip, picking up the glowing lantern. Light shone through the paper shapes.",
